---

The five theme layouts in this directory (Barebone, Matte, Protocol, Arcane,
and Studio) adapt palette, typography, font stacks, spacing, and button style
from the official React Email demos:

https://github.com/resend/react-email/tree/canary/apps/demo/emails

Folders used: 01-Barebone, 02-Matte, 03-Protocol, 04-Arcane, 05-Studio
(`theme.ts`, the `*-fonts.tsx` files, and the wrapper structure of
`welcome.tsx` and `activation.tsx`).

Those demos are MIT licensed. The notice above is copied from
`apps/demo/license.md` ("Copyright 2024 Plus Five Five, Inc").

Shellui uses the layout, palette, typography, and fonts only. Sample copy,
product names, and brand artwork from those demos are not included. Community
templates from that repository are not used.
